@startuml ansispire-audit-selfheal-as-built
title Audit + Self-Heal — AS-BUILT, 2026-07-12
caption Implemented. Docker E2E injects at sink and proves sink → reactor → remediation; relay is unit-tested separately.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

|Semaphore|
start
:task runs, emits events;
|Relay (relay.py)|
:cursor-paginated pull /api/events\n(resumable, heartbeat 60s);
|Sink (sink.py)|
:receive → append to **events.jsonl**\n(application-level append writer; not tamper-evident);
|Reactor (reactor.py v2.6)|
:tail events.jsonl · match rules.json;
if (event matches an **enabled** rule\nAND cooldown elapsed?) then (yes)
  :resolve template_name → id · **Bearer** auth;
  |Semaphore|
  :trigger remediation template (Task API)\ne.g. **Auto Remediation: Disk Cleanup**;
  :run disk_cleanup.yml;\nremediation task reaches success;
  stop
else (no)
  |Reactor (reactor.py v2.6)|
  :ignore / suppress (cooldown or no rule);
  stop
endif

note right
  Coverage boundary:
  - Docker E2E starts at sink (relay leg bypassed).
  - Return of remediation events through relay is not asserted.

  Excluded from AS-BUILT:
  - "DB Connection Failure" rule — enabled=false,
     db_failover.yml is a placeholder (TASK-008).
end note
@enduml
